      "location": "pte-api/services/scheduling/src/main/java/com/pte/scheduling/dto/response/ExamPolicyResponse.java:6-7",
      "evidence": "ExamPolicyResponse declared deviceCheckRequired/proctorRequired as primitive boolean while SessionMapper.toPolicy() sources them from ExamPolicy's boxed Boolean fields, which can be null before @PostLoad backfill runs (e.g. a transient, never-loaded ExamPolicy).",
      "why_it_matters": "Unboxing a null Boolean into a primitive boolean throws NPE, turning an edge case into a 500 at the API boundary instead of a handled state.",
      "required_action": "Change ExamPolicyResponse's deviceCheckRequired/proctorRequired to boxed Boolean.",
